@startuml
title F01 - Household profile and caregiver roles
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
actor "Household owner" as Owner
boundary "A01\nApp onboarding" as A01
control "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
control "B02\nHome/consent" as B02
control "B01\nIdentity/access" as B01
control "B08\nOperations/data" as B08
Owner -> A01: Enter home, timezone, resident consent, primary and backup caregivers
A01 -> S01: Validate versioned create-home command
A01 -> B02: POST home with idempotency key
B02 -> B01: Grant home-scoped owner and caregiver memberships
B02 -> B02: Persist consent, mode and distinct caregiver route
B02 -> B08: Append auditable home/role creation event
B02 --> A01: Return home ID, version and explicit validation result
note over A01,Owner: Cross-home access is never inferred from a serial number or global caregiver role.
note over Owner,B08: Outcome - A consented household exists with tenant-scoped owner, primary and distinct backup roles.
@enduml
